     </navPoint>
     </navPoint>
     <navPoint id="id9" playOrder="9">
       <navLabel>
         <text>三 灵与肉的斗争和统一</text>
       </navLabel>
       <content src="text00000.html#sigil_toc_id_8"/>
     <navPoint id="id10" playOrder="10">
       <navLabel>
         <text>(一)灵与肉既有矛盾，必有斗争;经过斗争，必有统一</text>
       </navLabel>
       <content src="text00000.html#sigil_toc_id_9"/>
     </navPoint>
     <navPoint id="id11" playOrder="11">
       <navLabel>
         <text>(二)灵与肉的统一</text>
       </navLabel>
       <content src="text00000.html#sigil_toc_id_10"/>
     </navPoint>
     <navPoint id="id12" playOrder="12">
       <navLabel>
         <text>(三)灵与肉的斗争中，谁做主?</text>
       </navLabel>
       <content src="text00000.html#sigil_toc_id_11"/>
     </navPoint>
     </navPoint>
     <navPoint id="id13" playOrder="13">
       <navLabel>
